notes = "Six native movement assignments replace the twelve legacy side-sheet rows below. Actual Step tracks own cadence, departure/arrival and airborne progress; Factory keeps its original finite source clock. Source programs contain the complete authored 3D part and are not replayed once per old back/front bank. All artwork remains unreviewed."
